Improve structure while keeping scientific changes identifiable (@rc-refactoring: 0, is #chapter, #part-of @reproducible-computation, #source "../sources/Good-Research-Code.lingua#r_771ZMSHAY1TCSTFCHPT9KZRA66", #source "../sources/Research-Software-Engineering.lingua#r_07D4PDD4HGKNK3PW4M90YSV2QY", #reproducible-computation "../environments/Interpreter-and-imports.lingua#r_135ETSE2H731NE6R14RF7XQ9VG") { r_449MB2D68DJG0C44H8FC540Q1Q
**Read:** [The Good Research Code Handbook — Mineault and community](../sources/Good-Research-Code.lingua#r_771ZMSHAY1TCSTFCHPT9KZRA66), the whole handbook and sample project; [Research Software Engineering with Python — Irving and colleagues](../sources/Research-Software-Engineering.lingua#r_07D4PDD4HGKNK3PW4M90YSV2QY), the full book and exercises, continuing in sequence.

Refactoring changes organization while intending to preserve behavior under a stated contract. A method change alters the scientific operation or its accepted domain. Both may be needed, but distinguish them so a reviewer can tell whether a changed result was expected. A faster loop, new numeric type, or library substitution can cross that boundary even when the source diff looks mechanical.

Establish independent reference cases and meaningful relational checks before reorganizing. Compare the public inputs/outputs, diagnostics, and side effects that matter. Exact byte equality may be appropriate for the small rational report; a different algorithm may require a predeclared numerical criterion instead. Explain any change in row ordering, rounding, missingness, or provenance fields.

Keep intermediate changes small enough to review. Moving code and correcting a scientific formula in the same large edit makes the reason for an output difference harder to inspect. Preserve the earlier method revision when it underlies a published result, then identify the corrected edition and its consequences. Version control makes both recoverable; the scientific account explains which should be used for which claim.

**Work:** reorganize the worked program into reading, calculation, and writing modules in your personal exercise project. Demonstrate equivalent numerical results and failure behavior on the independent benchmark set. Then add a new model option and give it separate tests, documentation, and method identity. Explain why an unchanged test count says little about whether the new domain is adequately checked.

Complete the handbook and the research-software book as sustained readings, including their projects. They provide repeated experience with changes larger than this teaching example. Use their comparison to decide which organizational practices actually help a future researcher reconstruct the method.

**Continue:** [Identify the interpreter and the code it actually imports](../environments/Interpreter-and-imports.lingua#r_135ETSE2H731NE6R14RF7XQ9VG).

